<Layout title="Tarian Compute — Exploring UK AI infrastructure" description="Early-stage exploration of UK compute infrastructure: power, connectivity, location and demand. Speak with Tarian about expertise and potential partnerships.">
  <PageIntro label="Tarian Compute / AI infrastructure" title="Understanding what makes compute viable."><p>Tarian Compute is an early-stage initiative exploring opportunities in UK digital and AI infrastructure.</p><p>Our current focus is understanding where demand, power, connectivity and location could support a commercially viable proposition.</p><p class="status">Research and early conversations</p></PageIntro>
  <section class="section shell split ruled-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">The questions shaping our work</p><h2>Start with the conditions.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Compute infrastructure depends on more than the technology inside a facility.</p><p>We are investigating how power availability, network connectivity, development requirements and future demand come together—and where the practical constraints sit.</p><p>This work is being developed within Tarian Ventures. A viable proposition would be progressed towards its own legal entity.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section tint-section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Areas of investigation</p><div class="research-grid">
    <section><span class="research-number">01</span><h2>Power &amp; location</h2><p>Understanding energy availability, site constraints and the requirements for potential development.</p></section>
    <section><span class="research-number">02</span><h2>Connectivity &amp; demand</h2><p>Exploring network requirements, prospective users and the conditions that could support demand.</p></section>
    <section><span class="research-number">03</span><h2>Delivery &amp; viability</h2><p>Testing commercial assumptions and understanding the expertise and partnerships a project would need.</p></section>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="section shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A useful first conversation</p><h2>Bring a perspective.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">We would like to hear from people with experience in power, connectivity, sites, infrastructure delivery or compute demand.</p><p>You may have a practical constraint to share, an opportunity worth examining or expertise that could help test our assumptions.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#compute">Discuss Tarian Compute <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
